                                    <h1>Jewelry Shopify Store Cost + Timeline in India + GCC (2026) | ITD GrowthLabs</h1>
                                    <div style="background:#fff7ed;border-left:4px solid #ff5722;padding:20px 24px;border-radius:10px;margin:24px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#334155;"><strong style="color:#ea580c;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:0.4px;">ITD JEWELRY PORTFOLIO &mdash; THE EVIDENCE:</strong><br>This article is written from live jewelry vertical work. ITD GrowthLabs is a specialist <a href="/industries/digital-marketing-for-jewelry-brands.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">digital marketing agency for jewelry brands</a> with a delivered <a href="/resources/Fabelia_Jewelry_D2C_Marketing_Strategy_Case_Study_2026.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Fabelia jewelry D2C case study</a>, 8+ published jewelry playbooks including <a href="/resources/Gold_vs_Diamond_Jewelry_D2C_Strategy_2026.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Gold vs Diamond D2C Strategy</a>, <a href="/resources/Jewelry_D2C_Digital_Transformation_India_Dubai_2026.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Jewelry D2C Digital Transformation India + Dubai</a>, <a href="/resources/Best_D2C_Jewellery_Brands_UAE_GCC_2026_2027.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Best D2C Jewellery Brands UAE + GCC</a>, and city-specific jewelry marketing pages across <a href="/services/gcc/dubai-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Dubai</a>, <a href="/services/gcc/abu-dhabi-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Abu Dhabi</a>, <a href="/services/gcc/jeddah-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Jeddah</a>, <a href="/services/gcc/doha-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Doha</a>, <a href="/services/gcc/dammam-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Dammam</a>, and <a href="/services/gcc/al-khobar-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Al Khobar</a>. Every framework below is grounded in live category work &mdash; not generic D2C theory.</div><p>Jewelry Shopify build cost varies 5-10x depending on scope + tier + region. A boutique fashion jewelry Shopify with 30 SKUs starts at Rs 2 lakh + 4 weeks. Enterprise fine + bridal Shopify with multi-region + AR + video consultation + custom features hits Rs 15-25 lakh + 16 weeks. Understanding what actually drives cost prevents both over-scoping + under-investing.</p><p>This piece walks through realistic cost + timeline benchmarks by tier + region + what's included at each level.</p>
                                    <h2>Tier 1 &amp;mdash; Boutique Shopify (Rs 2-4 lakh, 4-6 weeks)</h2>
                                    <p><strong>Right for:</strong> Fashion jewelry launches + Rs 25L-2 Cr / month revenue + 30-80 SKU catalogue + India-only or single-market.</p><p><strong>Build scope:</strong> Dawn (free) or premium theme ($280 Prestige / Impulse), core jewelry apps (Klaviyo + WhatsApp + Judge.me + wishlist), 30-80 SKUs migrated + basic customisation, basic 360 view (if applicable), payment gateway (Razorpay + Cashfree standard limits), basic Shopify SEO + schema.</p><p><strong>What is NOT included:</strong> AR try-on integration, video consultation booking, insurance-integrated checkout, multi-region + multi-currency, custom features.</p><p><strong>Timeline:</strong> Week 1-2 discovery + theme selection + SKU data. Week 3-4 build + apps + customisation. Week 5 QA + testing. Week 6 launch.</p><p><strong>Ongoing:</strong> Rs 15-40K / month tooling (Shopify subscription + apps) + optional Rs 30-80K / month post-launch retainer for iteration + features.</p>
                                    <h2>Tier 2 &amp;mdash; Mid-market Shopify (Rs 4-8 lakh, 6-10 weeks)</h2>
                                    <p><strong>Right for:</strong> Fine + fashion hybrid + Rs 2-25 Cr / month revenue + 100-300 SKU catalogue + India + GCC.</p><p><strong>Build scope:</strong> Premium theme ($280-400) with jewelry-specific customisation, full jewelry apps stack (Klaviyo + Interakt WhatsApp + Judge.me + Growave wishlist + Loox + Route insurance), 100-300 SKUs, 360 view + AR try-on integration (MirrAR / Jewelfie), video consultation booking widget, high-value payment (Razorpay + Cashfree enhanced-limits + EMI + BNPL), Shopify SEO + schema deployment (Product + Organization + LocalBusiness + Review + FAQPage + BreadcrumbList).</p><p><strong>What is NOT included:</strong> Full multi-region multi-currency (adds Rs 1-3 lakh), Arabic + Hindi content variants (Rs 2-4 lakh), custom Shopify apps or private theme.</p><p><strong>Timeline:</strong> Week 1-2 discovery + workshop. Week 3-5 theme + apps + customisation. Week 6-8 SKU migration + content + testing. Week 9-10 QA + launch.</p><p><strong>Ongoing:</strong> Rs 30-80K / month tooling + Rs 40K-1.5 lakh / month post-launch retainer for CRO + iteration + features.</p>
                                    <h2>Tier 3 &amp;mdash; Enterprise + Multi-Region (Rs 8-15 lakh, 10-16 weeks)</h2>
                                    <p><strong>Right for:</strong> Fine + bridal + luxury + Rs 5-25 Cr / month revenue + 300+ SKUs + India + GCC + international (US + UK).</p><p><strong>Build scope:</strong> Custom theme built from scratch or heavily-customised premium theme, advanced apps stack + custom integrations, 300+ SKUs migrated, full 360 + AR + video consultation + Live Shopping integration, insurance-integrated checkout (Route + Corso), multi-region (India + UAE + KSA + US + UK + Canada + Australia + Singapore), multi-currency (INR + AED + SAR + USD + GBP + AUD + CAD + SGD), multi-language (Hindi + Arabic + English + optional Tamil / Malayalam / Bengali), Shopify SEO + schema at scale, GA4 + Meta Pixel + Conversion API + WhatsApp CTWA + CRM sync.</p><p><strong>Timeline:</strong> Week 1-3 discovery + workshop + design. Week 4-8 build + customisation + apps + integrations. Week 9-12 SKU migration + content + multi-language + multi-currency + testing. Week 13-15 CRO + performance + accessibility. Week 16 launch.</p><p><strong>Ongoing:</strong> Rs 60K-1.5 lakh / month tooling + Rs 80K-Rs 2.5 lakh / month post-launch dev retainer.</p>
                                    <h2>Tier 4 &amp;mdash; Headless Shopify (Rs 12-25 lakh, 12-18 weeks)</h2>
                                    <p><strong>Right for:</strong> Enterprise-scale jewelry brands with Rs 5 Cr+ / month revenue + performance-critical requirements + custom-feature-heavy roadmap + multi-region multi-tenant.</p><p><strong>Architecture:</strong> Shopify Hydrogen or Next.js frontend + Shopify Plus backend + custom middleware + Sanity or Contentful headless CMS + advanced GA4 + Meta CAPI + custom analytics.</p><p><strong>Build scope:</strong> Custom frontend + advanced page speed optimisation (LCP under 1.5s) + custom features (AR + video + concierge + custom Shopify apps) + multi-region multi-currency multi-language + full analytics + attribution stack + custom checkout extensions (Shopify Plus).</p><p><strong>Timeline:</strong> Week 1-4 discovery + architecture + design system. Week 5-12 build + custom features + integrations. Week 13-16 SKU migration + content + testing. Week 17-18 launch.</p><p><strong>Ongoing:</strong> Rs 1-3 lakh / month tooling + Rs 1.5-4 lakh / month dev retainer (mandatory for headless maintenance + updates + features).</p>
                                    <h2>Regional cost variations</h2>
                                    <p><strong>India:</strong> Base costs quoted above. Mumbai + Delhi + Bengaluru talent 10-20% premium vs tier-2 city agencies.</p><p><strong>UAE (Dubai + Abu Dhabi):</strong> AED 25K-150K (Rs 5.5L-33L) for Tier 2-3 equivalents. Higher agency + talent overhead + trilingual creative + regional-payment gateway setup.</p><p><strong>Saudi Arabia:</strong> SAR 35K-200K (Rs 8L-46L) for Tier 2-3. Saudi-specific compliance (SASO + KSA VAT + Arabic-first creative + Snapchat integration).</p><p><strong>Multi-region simultaneous launch:</strong> India + UAE + KSA simultaneous adds 30-50% to base tier cost due to regional creative + payment + carrier + compliance setup.</p>

                                    <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 100%); padding: 40px; border-radius: 12px; margin: 40px 0; text-align: center; color: #fff;">
