                                        <p style="color:#ccc;margin-bottom:25px;">Book a free 30-minute jewelry D2C discovery call. We map your brand + funnel + share a customised proposal within 3 working days.</p>
                                        <a href="https://www.itdgrowthlabs.com/contact-us.php" style="background:#ff5722;color:#fff;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;display:inline-block;margin-right:10px;">Contact Us Today</a>
                                        <a href="https://calendly.com/itdgrowthlabs-info/30min" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="js-book-call" data-source="blog_cta" style="background:#1565c0;color:#fff;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;display:inline-block;">Book Free 30-min Call</a>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>How much does a jewelry Shopify store cost to build?</h3>
                                        <p>Rs 2-4 lakh Boutique (4-6 weeks). Rs 4-8 lakh Mid-market (6-10 weeks). Rs 8-15 lakh Enterprise (10-16 weeks). Rs 12-25 lakh Headless (12-18 weeks). Regional variations: AED 25K-150K UAE, SAR 35K-200K Saudi. Multi-region simultaneous launch adds 30-50%.</p>
                                        <h3>What is included in a Rs 4-8 lakh Mid-market jewelry Shopify build?</h3>
                                        <p>Premium theme + jewelry-specific customisation, full jewelry apps stack (Klaviyo + Interakt + Judge.me + Growave + Loox + Route), 100-300 SKUs, 360 view + AR try-on, video consultation booking, high-value payment (Razorpay + Cashfree enhanced-limits + EMI + BNPL), Shopify SEO + schema deployment.</p>
                                        <h3>Do we need Shopify Plus for a jewelry brand?</h3>
                                        <p>Rs 25L-2 Cr / month revenue = regular Shopify sufficient. Rs 2-25 Cr = Shopify Plus starts to make sense ($2K USD / month + advanced features). Rs 5 Cr+ / month + custom-feature-heavy = Shopify Plus mandatory. Headless (Hydrogen + Next.js) at Rs 5 Cr+ / month + performance-critical + custom-heavy roadmap.</p>
                                        <h3>How long does a jewelry Shopify build take?</h3>
                                        <p>4-6 weeks Boutique. 6-10 weeks Mid-market. 10-16 weeks Enterprise. 12-18 weeks Headless. Timelines assume proper discovery + design + client responsiveness on SKU data + content + feedback cycles.</p>
                                        <h3>What ongoing costs come after Shopify launch?</h3>
                                        <p>Rs 15-40K / month tooling (Boutique) to Rs 1-3 lakh / month (Enterprise Headless) covering Shopify subscription + apps + integrations. Post-launch dev retainer Rs 30K-Rs 4 lakh / month depending on iteration cadence + feature roadmap + CRO + A/B testing scope.</p>
                                        <h3>How does UAE Shopify build cost compare to India?</h3>
                                        <p>UAE: AED 25K-150K (Rs 5.5L-33L) for Tier 2-3 equivalents. Higher agency + talent overhead (Dubai + Abu Dhabi are premium markets). Trilingual creative + regional-payment gateway (Emirates NBD + Network International) + multi-currency + ESMA compliance setup adds to base cost.</p>
                                        <h3>What about Saudi Arabia Shopify build cost?</h3>
                                        <p>SAR 35K-200K (Rs 8L-46L) for Tier 2-3. Saudi-specific compliance (SASO + KSA 15% VAT) + Arabic-first creative + Snapchat integration + culturally-conservative model + imagery adjustments add to base cost. Higher Snapchat + Instagram + WhatsApp channel-integration requirements.</p>
                                        <h3>How does ITD GrowthLabs price jewelry Shopify builds?</h3>
                                        <p>Standard tier pricing (Rs 2-25 lakh) with bundled discovery + workshop + design + build + apps + integrations + SKU migration + content + testing + launch. Optional bundled post-launch retainer + marketing (Rs 40K-Rs 4 lakh / month). See our <a href="/resources/jewelry_shopify_store_template_apps_stack.php">Shopify build playbook</a> + <a href="/industries/digital-marketing-for-jewelry-brands.php">jewelry vertical page</a>.</p>
